            <div xml:id="d26-a1">

                <pb facs="0558" n="548" xml:id="pg548"/>

                <head>Appendix [A] to HD–110</head>
                <p>The three [<hi rendition="#italic">sic</hi>] memoranda herewith comprise:</p>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>) Resolutions of Supreme Council H.D. 102 (1),
                    H.D. 104 (VI [<hi rendition="#italic">IX</hi>]) and H.D. 106 (II), as
                    unanimously understood by the Naval Advisers.</p>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>) Proposals regarding the distribution of Enemy
                    Surface Warships, as amended by the Resolutions of the Supreme Council on the
                    British Memorandum of November 14th, 1919.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d26-f1"/></p>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>) Draft Orders for the Inter-Allied Naval
                    Commission charged by the Supreme Council with superintending the disposal of
                    the surrendered enemy warships.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d26-f2"/></p>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>) Copies of Supreme Council Resolutions:— <table
                        cols="2" rows="4">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell>H.D. 101 (1)</cell>
                            <cell>28/11/19<anchor n="14" xml:id="d26-f3"/></cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>H.D. 102 (1)</cell>
                            <cell>29/11/19<anchor n="15" xml:id="d26-f4"/></cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>H.D. 104 (VI[<hi rendition="#italic">IX</hi>])</cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>H.D. 106 (II)</cell>
                            <cell>4/12/19<anchor n="17" xml:id="d26-f5"/></cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
